  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        74.39279174804688,
        278.305908203125,
        88.81379699707031
      ],
      "text": "BCG vaccination for HIV-infected infants",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiboldItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        96.18341827392578,
        485.8572998046875,
        110.62641906738281
      ],
      "text": "Children who are HIV-infected when vaccinated with BCG at birth are at increased risk of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        108.18341827392578,
        508.03118896484375,
        122.62641906738281
      ],
      "text": "developing disseminated BCG disease. However, if HIV-infected individuals including children,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        120.18341827392578,
        515.4176025390625,
        134.6264190673828
      ],
      "text": "are receiving ART, are clinically well and immunologically stable (CD4% >25% for children aged",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        132.1834259033203,
        460.28179931640625,
        146.6264190673828
      ],
      "text": "<5 years or CD4 count ≥200 if aged >5 years) they should be vaccinated with BCG.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        148.43544006347656,
        515.4423828125,
        162.87843322753906
      ],
      "text": "•\tIn general, populations with high prevalence of HIV infection also have the greatest burden of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        84.04429626464844,
        160.43544006347656,
        505.3983154296875,
        174.87843322753906
      ],
      "text": "TB; in such populations the benefits of potentially preventing severe TB through vaccination",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        84.04429626464844,
        172.43544006347656,
        500.15899658203125,
        186.87843322753906
      ],
      "text": "at birth are outweighed by the risks associated with the use of BCG vaccine. Therefore, it is",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        84.04429626464844,
        184.43544006347656,
        266.7845153808594,
        198.87843322753906
      ],
      "text": "recommended that in such populations:",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04429626464844,
        200.68739318847656,
        501.84625244140625,
        215.13038635253906
      ],
      "text": "Neonates born to women of unknown HIV status should be vaccinated as the benefits of  –",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        93.04429626464844,
        212.68739318847656,
        255.2293243408203,
        227.13038635253906
      ],
      "text": "BCG vaccination outweigh the risks.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04429626464844,
        228.9394073486328,
        512.0630493164062,
        243.3824005126953
      ],
      "text": "Neonates of unknown HIV status born to HIV-infected women should be vaccinated if they  –",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        93.04429626464844,
        240.9394073486328,
        502.9737243652344,
        255.3824005126953
      ],
      "text": "have no clinical evidence suggestive of HIV infection, regardless of whether the mother is",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        93.04429626464844,
        252.9394073486328,
        156.6197967529297,
        267.3824157714844
      ],
      "text": "receiving ART.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04429626464844,
        269.1912841796875,
        510.5417175292969,
        283.6343078613281
      ],
      "text": "Although evidence is limited, for neonates with HIV infection confirmed by early virological  –",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        93.04429626464844,
        281.1912841796875,
        484.8006896972656,
        295.6343078613281
      ],
      "text": "testing, BCG vaccination should be delayed until ART has been started and the infant",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        93.04429626464844,
        293.1912841796875,
        405.8744812011719,
        307.6343078613281
      ],
      "text": "confirmed to be clinically and immunologically stable (CD4% >25%).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        314.696044921875,
        496.6437072753906,
        329.051025390625
      ],
      "text": "TB preventive treatment: WHO consolidated guidelines on tuberculosis. Module 1 –",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        326.6300048828125,
        363.0567932128906,
        341.0509948730469
      ],
      "text": "(14) prevention – tuberculosis preventive treatment, 2020",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiboldItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        348.2445983886719,
        476.5081481933594,
        362.66558837890625
      ],
      "text": "Identifying populations for TB infection testing and TPT – people living with HIV",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiboldItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        370.03521728515625,
        504.1305847167969,
        384.4782409667969
      ],
      "text": "Adults and adolescents living with HIV who are unlikely to have TB disease should receive TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        382.03521728515625,
        505.2183837890625,
        396.4782409667969
      ],
      "text": "preventive treatment as part of a comprehensive package of HIV care. Treatment should also",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        394.03521728515625,
        489.5026550292969,
        408.4782409667969
      ],
      "text": "be given to those on antiretroviral treatment, to pregnant women and to those who have",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        406.03521728515625,
        517.4888916015625,
        420.4782409667969
      ],
      "text": "previously been treated for TB, irrespective of the degree of immunosuppression and even if TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        418.03521728515625,
        220.45034790039062,
        432.4782409667969
      ],
      "text": "infection testing is unavailable.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        431.49310302734375,
        373.8985900878906,
        448.67510986328125
      ],
      "text": "(Strong recommendation, high certainty in the estimates of effect)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        455.9017028808594,
        497.4315185546875,
        470.3447265625
      ],
      "text": "Infants aged <12 months living with HIV who are in contact with a person with TB and who",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        467.9017028808594,
        503.341796875,
        482.3447265625
      ],
      "text": "are unlikely to have TB disease on an appropriate clinical evaluation or according to national",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        479.9017028808594,
        311.5291748046875,
        494.3447265625
      ],
      "text": "guidelines should receive TB preventive treatment.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        493.3597412109375,
        397.5743713378906,
        510.5417175292969
      ],
      "text": "(Strong recommendation, moderate certainty in the estimates of effect)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        517.768310546875,
        506.6593933105469,
        532.2113037109375
      ],
      "text": "Children aged ≥12 months living with HIV who are considered unlikely to have TB disease on",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        529.768310546875,
        493.3164978027344,
        544.2113037109375
      ],
      "text": "an appropriate clinical evaluation or according to national guidelines should be offered TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        541.768310546875,
        503.0415344238281,
        556.2113037109375
      ],
      "text": "preventive treatment as part of a comprehensive package of HIV prevention and care if they",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        553.768310546875,
        408.32269287109375,
        568.2113037109375
      ],
      "text": "live in a setting with high TB transmission, regardless of contact with TB.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        567.2262573242188,
        369.4512939453125,
        584.4082641601562
      ],
      "text": "(Strong recommendation, low certainty in the estimates of effect)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        591.6348876953125,
        492.0987243652344,
        606.077880859375
      ],
      "text": "All children living with HIV who have successfully completed treatment for TB disease may",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        603.6348876953125,
        228.632080078125,
        618.077880859375
      ],
      "text": "receive TB preventive treatment.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        617.0928955078125,
        391.6231994628906,
        634.27490234375
      ],
      "text": "(Conditional recommendation, low certainty in the estimates of effect)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        641.3255615234375,
        518.1716918945312,
        655.7465209960938
      ],
      "text": "Identifying populations for TB infection testing and TB preventive treatment – household",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiboldItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        653.3255615234375,
        245.93312072753906,
        667.7465209960938
      ],
      "text": "contacts (regardless of HIV status)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiboldItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        675.1160278320312,
        515.9906616210938,
        689.5590209960938
      ],
      "text": "Children aged <5 years who are household contacts of people with bacteriologically confirmed",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        687.1160278320312,
        512.4916381835938,
        701.5590209960938
      ],
      "text": "pulmonary TB and who are found not to have TB disease on an appropriate clinical evaluation",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        699.1160278320312,
        519.7164306640625,
        713.5590209960938
      ],
      "text": "or according to national guidelines should be given TB preventive treatment even if TB infection",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        711.1160278320312,
        178.2433319091797,
        725.5590209960938
      ],
      "text": "testing is unavailable.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        724.573974609375,
        373.8985900878906,
        741.7559814453125
      ],
      "text": "(Strong recommendation, high certainty in the estimates of effect)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        461.41339111328125,
        801.0170288085938,
        554.0401611328125,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "3. Prevention of TB 13",
